@*
    The Router's fallback. It offers a way back into the catalog rather than a dead end,
    and it is also what a shopper reaches by following a link to a feature that has not
    been built yet, so it says so plainly instead of implying the shop is broken.
*@
@page "/not-found"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>Off the chart &middot; Vela Commerce</PageTitle>

<div class="vc-empty">
    <span class="vc-eyebrow">404</span>
    <h1 class="vc-empty__title">Off the chart</h1>
    <p class="vc-empty__body">
        There is nothing at this address. It may be a page that has not been built yet, or a
        product that is no longer in the catalog.
    </p>
    <div class="vc-alert__actions">
        <a class="vc-btn vc-btn--primary" href="">Back to the catalog</a>
    </div>
</div>
